---
/** Quick links and short setup wizards for non-ESP paths. */
---

<section class="card" id="device-integrations">
  <h2 class="card-title">Other ways to connect</h2>
  <p class="card-subtitle mb-4">
    ESP push ingest is the default. Expand a path below for copy-paste setup.
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <details class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-3">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">Home Assistant REST</summary>
      <ol class="mt-3 mb-0 text-sm space-y-2 pl-4 list-decimal">
        <li>Create a push device above and copy the ingest URL.</li>
        <li>
          In HA, use a <code>rest</code> sensor or automation with
          <code>resource: https://thermaltrace.dev/api/ingest/YOUR_KEY</code>.
        </li>
        <li>
          POST entity JSON. ThermalTrace reads <code>friendly_name</code> for labels.
          <a class="text-link" href="/integrations/home-assistant">Full HA guide</a>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </details>

    <details class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-3">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">MQTT → HTTPS bridge</summary>
      <ol class="mt-3 mb-0 text-sm space-y-2 pl-4 list-decimal">
        <li>Keep Mosquitto on your LAN. ThermalTrace is not an MQTT broker.</li>
        <li>
          Import the Node-RED flow from
          <a class="text-link" href="/dashboard/share/integrations#node-red">Integrations → Node-RED</a>
          or run the Python bridge in <code>scripts/mqtt-bridge.py</code>.
        </li>
        <li>Set <code>THERMALTRACE_INGEST_KEY</code> to your push device key.</li>
        <li>
          <a class="text-link" href="/about/mqtt-bridge">MQTT bridge docs</a>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </details>

    <details class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-3">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium">ESPHome / Shelly LAN</summary>
      <p class="mt-3 mb-2 text-sm">
        Point ESPHome <code>rest</code> or Shelly HTTP at your ingest URL, or expose HTTPS JSON for a pull feed.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link text-sm" href="/dashboard/share/integrations#esphome">ESPHome &amp; Shelly recipes</a>
    </details>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4">
    <a class="btn-ghost" href="/about/ingest-and-webhooks">Ingest formats</a>
    <a class="btn-ghost" href="/integrations">All integrations</a>
  </div>
</section>
